# Publications, samples, and scaffolds. Wikimap ranks by information content, so
# a term that is rare in the corpus carries the weight. The guidance library is
# written in English, which left the two Korean publications below as the entire
# Korean corpus: every Korean request ranked them first and then pulled their
# markdown neighbours -- AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, README.md, the bootstrap cards --
# in as reference candidates, whatever the request was about. None of these is
# guidance an agent reads to make a decision. Routing is unaffected: concern,
# platform, surface, and graph selection never go through this index, and
# `templates/repo-agents-routing.md` still matches its path surface when it is
# the file being changed.

# Localized publications. AGENTS.md: public docs may be localized but do not
# become the guidance source of truth.
